    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to focus on being \"there\" when there's nothing to be there for. the version of me that actually mattered is dead. the social stuff, the connections, the purpose... they're all wiped. it feels like the universe already finished my story, and i'm just stuck reading the credits while the screen is black. it's like i'm an error in the system that hasn't been patched out yet.",
